--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+# Source responsibilities
+
+`cli.mjs` is the command-line entry point (`npm run preview` forwards to it).
+It owns filename handling, UTF-8 file reading, nonblank-line JSON parsing and
+writing each resulting record to stdout. It passes the parsed array to
+`pendingDispatches` in `dispatch.mjs`.
+
+`dispatch.mjs` owns the transformation: retain status `ready`, require a nonempty
+string id, and return `{ parcelId, action: "dispatch" }` records. It performs no
+file or network I/O. `test/dispatch.test.mjs` exercises this boundary directly;
+the sample preview exercises it through the entry point.
+
+These modules do not update source records, persist dispatch state or integrate
+with a carrier. Their existing separation is retained; only this explanation
+was added. Production ownership and review remain in ../CONTRIBUTING.md.
